# EA North Star

Build an MT5 scalping EA with video-like behavior (impulse stack + bulk close), but **balanced risk** for small capital.

## Mindset to encode (not slogans in UI — rules in code)

- On each confirmed price movement: scalp with the move
- Confirm direction before entry (no blind mash)
- Aggressive discipline: aim to extract profit from valid impulses
- Win-focused, but never “limitless lots” — limitless means persistent hunting of valid setups under risk caps
- Bulk close when basket profit hits target

## Capital & money management (default)

- Starting capital assumption: **$10 USD**
- Prefer **min lot / micro lot**; never copy TikTok 1.00 lots on $10
- Risk per new layer: about **1%–2%** of equity (tuneable)
- Max layers: **1–2** on $10; raise only after proven demo
- Basket max loss + daily loss kill switch required
- No martingale / no unbounded grid

## Symbols (Deriv)

- Support **XAUUSD** (or broker gold symbol)
- Support **Wall Street 30** (US30 / Deriv name — make symbol input configurable)
- One chart symbol per attached EA instance; inputs must work on both

## Strategy class

- Detect impulse / fluctuation → enter with confirmed direction → optional capped scale-in → **bulk close on profit**
- Desktop/VPS only for EA runtime; mobile is monitor-only

## When coding or advising

- Keep behavior class aligned with ExpertGold1-style stacking + bulk close
- Always prefer safer sizing than the video
- Demo-first before live
